id=ndot_cjk_font
name=Ndot CJK System Font
version=v1.7
versionCode=8
author=Chris Wong
description=Nothing Ndot dot-matrix system font. Chinese (HK/TW/CN forms), Japanese and Korean redrawn as 12px Ndot-style dots. Noto CJK stays as fallback. Optional custom emoji slot (/sdcard/NdotCJK/Emoji.ttf). Turn off "Umount modules" in KernelSU settings.
